// Translations of the UI, embedded in SKIF.exe (see include\utility\l10n.h)
//
// Kept by hand: this file is not maintained by the Visual Studio resource editor, unlike SKIF.rc.
//
// One line per language:  <name>  SKIF_PO  "resources\\l10n\\<file>.po"
//   The language is taken from the "Language:" header of the .po file, or else from <name>.
//   <name> must be a plain identifier (letters, digits and underscores), e.g. de, pt_BR, zh_Hans.
//
// Translations in <Special K folder>\Languages\*.po are loaded as well, and take priority over these.
//
// Example:
//   de      SKIF_PO "resources\\l10n\\de.po"
//   pt_BR   SKIF_PO "resources\\l10n\\pt_BR.po"

